{"lyrics":"[00:00.14](Cardo Got Wings)\n[00:01.90]Now we cookin' up, hey\n[00:04.50]Yeah\n[00:06.50]Leave her in the past, but I know I'll miss her\n[00:09.94]I kept all of her paraphernalia\n[00:12.54]Left her makeup and her panties on my bedroom dresser\n[00:16.16]Think about the days when I used to undress her\n[00:19.38]Long gone, long gone, long gone, ayy (Long gone, long gone, long gone)\n[00:25.82]Long gone, long gone, long gone, ayy (Long gone, long gone, long gone)\n[00:29.64]Long gone, long gone, long gone (Long gone, long gone, long gone)\n[00:32.00]Long gone, yeah, ayy (Long gone)\n[00:33.04]Sorrow and sadness next to me\n[00:35.54]Old hoes see that I'm on, so they textin' me\n[00:38.76]Ex-bitch tryna finesse me, she won't get a damn thing\n[00:45.16]Listen to my story, it's depressing\n[00:48.40]Heartbreak mixed with the drugs, not the best thing\n[00:51.40]The devil tryna test me I'm failing, inhaling\n[00:57.66]You took it all back (Back)\n[01:01.36]All that heartbreak that was a year ago\n[01:04.54]Wanted you back (Back) so bad, but that's\n[01:10.94]Long gone, long gone, long gone, ayy (Long gone, long gone, long gone)\n[01:14.14]Long gone, long gone, long gone, ayy (Long gone, long gone, long gone)\n[01:18.96]Long gone, long gone, long gone (Long gone, long gone, long gone)\n[01:22.42]Long gone (Long gone)\n[01:23.62]What you don't seem to understand is\n[01:26.84]You really took my love for granted\n[01:28.52]You really had me feeling helpless, that's so selfish\n[01:36.72]Haven't been in love in a long while\n[01:39.92]Wait until my next girl finds out\n[01:42.74]That I'm scared we gon' break up and fall out\n[01:45.52]Drownin' in my thoughts, baby, looking for a lighthouse\n[01:48.82]Ain't no sleep, I've been feeling like a night owl\n[01:51.98]Music turnt up, neighbors telling me to pipe down\n[01:55.30]On the other hand, I think I found my future wife\n[01:58.24]But she not here with me, so it get lonely at night, ayy\n[01:59.82]I hope her love doesn't go away\n[02:01.12]I hope this ain't a phase\n[02:03.80]One more heartbreak and I'll be\n[02:05.12]Long gone, long gone, long gone, ayy (Long gone, long gone, long gone)\n[02:07.82]Long gone, long gone, long gone, ayy (Long gone, long gone, long gone)\n[02:12.14]Long gone, long gone, long gone (Long gone, long gone, long gone)\n[02:17.40]Long gone, yeah, ayy (Long gone)\n[02:19.38]Long gone, long gone, long gone, ayy (Long gone, long gone, long gone)\n[02:23.84]Long gone, long gone, long gone, ayy (Long gone, long gone, long gone)\n[02:31.46]Long gone, long gone, long gone (Long gone, long gone, long gone)\n[02:37.88]Long gone, yeah, ayy (Long gone)\n[02:41.12]Leave her in the past, but I know I'll miss her\n[02:44.56]I kept all of her paraphernalia\n[02:47.18]Left her makeup and her panties on my bedroom dresser\n[02:50.78]Think about the days when I used to undress her","words":[[0.14,0.44,"(Cardo"],[0.56,0.74,"Got"],[1.0,1.74,"Wings)"],[1.9,2.04,"Now"],[2.08,2.14,"we"],[2.24,2.58,"cookin'"],[2.64,2.72,"up,"],[2.86,3.04,"hey"],[4.5,4.68,"Yeah"],[6.5,6.74,"Leave"],[6.82,6.86,"her"],[7.0,7.06,"in"],[7.1,7.14,"the"],[7.26,7.62,"past,"],[7.7,7.84,"but"],[7.98,7.98,"I"],[8.06,8.26,"know"],[8.44,8.62,"I'll"],[8.7,9.06,"miss"],[9.12,9.28,"her"],[9.94,9.94,"I"],[10.08,10.52,"kept"],[10.6,10.92,"all"],[11.02,11.1,"of"],[11.16,11.2,"her"],[11.3,12.48,"paraphernalia"],[12.54,12.72,"Left"],[12.76,12.84,"her"],[12.94,13.36,"makeup"],[13.42,13.54,"and"],[13.58,13.64,"her"],[13.74,14.14,"panties"],[14.24,14.28,"on"],[14.34,14.46,"my"],[14.52,15.04,"bedroom"],[15.14,15.76,"dresser"],[16.16,16.36,"Think"],[16.44,16.72,"about"],[16.78,16.84,"the"],[16.98,17.3,"days"],[17.4,17.54,"when"],[17.7,17.7,"I"],[17.82,17.98,"used"],[18.04,18.08,"to"],[18.18,18.78,"undress"],[18.98,19.12,"her"],[19.38,19.68,"Long"],[19.76,20.1,"gone,"],[20.18,20.46,"long"],[20.56,20.92,"gone,"],[20.98,21.3,"long"],[21.38,21.8,"gone,"],[22.16,22.56,"ayy"],[22.6,22.86,"(Long"],[22.98,23.34,"gone,"],[